\"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What\u2019s included in a whole home remodel in Oregon City, OR?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"A whole home remodel typically covers every major area of your house, including the kitchen, bathrooms, bedrooms, living spaces, and sometimes even exteriors. In Oregon City, OR, many homeowners also choose to update layouts for more open living, add energy-efficient features for year-round comfort, and modernize finishes to match the Central Oregon lifestyle.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can I stay in my Oregon City, OR home during a full remodel?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"It depends on the scope of the project. For smaller or phased remodels, many Oregon City homeowners are able to stay in their homes while work is being completed. However, for large-scale renovations that affect plumbing, electrical, or multiple key areas at once, it may be more comfortable to arrange temporary housing during the process. Our team will guide you through the best option based on your specific project.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How do you manage such large projects?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"We follow a detailed project plan and timeline, with regular updates and checkpoints.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Is financing available for large remodels?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, we offer financing options to make large projects more manageable.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How do I get started with a whole home remodel?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Just book a consultation. We\u2019ll assess your needs and create a custom proposal.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n<\/script>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f5cc54e elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"f5cc54e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;gradient&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-13190f7\" data-id=\"13190f7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-b6f500a elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b6f500a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-704e71a\" data-id=\"704e71a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2800a2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d2800a2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" wi